.SH NAME
\fBGCmalloc\fR \- precision GC for C\&.
.SH DESCRIPTION
This is a incremental Tri\-color GC for C, written in C\&. API has
\fB7\fR functions, \fB4\fR types, one variable and \fB8\fR macro\&.
.SH TYPES
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGCu8\fR \- unsigned char alias
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGCDestructor\fR \- destructor for GC
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGCObject\fR \- GC object
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGCState\fR \- current GC state
(variable: gGCState \- global GC state)
.SH FUNCTIONS
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGCMalloc\fR \- allocate memory
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGCMallocDep\fR \- allocate and link return pointer with \fIdep\fR
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGCMallocChild\fR \- allocate memory, but set to *parent* as dependency pointer
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGCAddDependency\fR \- add to \fIptr\fR dependency \fIdep\fR\&.
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGCWriteBarrier\fR \- change colors if \fIptr\fR is black and \fIdep\fR is white
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBRunGC\fR \- run GC with \fIsteps\fR steps
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGCRegDestructor\fR \- register destructor to \fIptr\fR
.SH MACRO
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGC_START\fR, \fBGC_DEPS\fR, \fBGC_SWEEP\fR: GC state values
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGC_INIT()\fR \- save current roots to secret variable on stack\&.
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGC_DEINIT()\fR \- return saved current roots from secret variable\&.
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGCreturn\fR \- wrapper for \fBGC_DEINIT()\fR and \fBreturn\fR\&.
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGC_SET_PTR()\fR \- do \fIparent\fR\-\fIfield\fR = \fIchild\fR with barrier check\&.
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBGC_FULL_RUN()\fR \- run \fBStop\-the\-world\fR GC\&.
